    "description": "Breaking News Brief delivers the world\u2019s most accurate, reliable news sources\u2014all in one place. News alerts will keep you up to date on breaking news, local news, and more.\r\n\r\nOur news aggregator delivers the top, breaking news stories and live updates that matter to you right at your fingertips! Local, trending news in your area is gathered when you enter your zip code, and US news delivers nationwide updates. Receive news updates and alerts straight to your phone as it happens, so you are always in the know.\r\n\r\n\r\n<h2>Breaking News</h2>\r\n\u2022 Local News\r\n\u2022 US News\r\n\u2022 Worldwide Events\r\n\r\n<b>US News Alerts & Topics by Interest</b>\r\n\u2022 Business news\r\n\u2022 Political News\r\n\u2022 Entertainment News\r\n\u2022 Finance News\r\n\r\n<b>News Aggregator Filtered From</b>\r\n\u2022 ABC News\r\n\u2022 Fox News\r\n\u2022 CNN\r\n\u2022 Huffington Post\r\n\u2022 and more!\r\n\r\n\u2b07\ufe0f Download Breaking New Brief today and stay up-to-date on all your news needs.",
